/P 277 0 R
/E (WE CHOSE MANIPULATING INTERACTION BECAUSE USERS WILL ENGAGE WITH THE APPLICATION BY DRAGGING, SELECTING, SWIPING, AND SCROLLING THROUGH OPTIONS, SUCH AS CHOOSING CLOTHING STYLES OR EXPLORING RECOMMENDED COLOR PALETTES. THIS INTERACTION CREATES A MORE ENGAGING AND DYNAMIC EXPERIENCE, ALLOWING USERS TO SEE THE RESULTS OF THEIR CHOICES IN REAL TIME.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
510 0 obj
<<
