1045 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 311 0 R
/E (THE PRIMARY OBJECTIVE OF THIS PROJECT WAS TO DEVELOP A USER-FRIENDLY AND AI-DRIVEN FASHION APPLICATION THAT CONNECTS FASHION SEEKERS WITH PERSONALIZED OUTFIT RECOMMENDATIONS AND DESIGNERS LOOKING TO SHOWCASE THEIR WORK. BY LEVERAGING AI ALGORITHMS, THE APPLICATION ENSURES CUSTOMIZED SUGGESTIONS BASED ON USERS' SKIN TONES, BODY SHAPES, AND SIZES, MAKING FASHION MORE INCLUSIVE AND ACCESSIBLE.)
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1046 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 311 0 R
/E (THE CORE FUNCTIONALITIES OF THE APPLICATION INCLUDE USER PROFILE CREATION, AI-POWERED FASHION RECOMMENDATIONS, AN INTERACTIVE WISHLIST, AND A PLATFORM FOR DESIGNERS TO DISPLAY THEIR COLLECTIONS. ADDITIONALLY, THE APPLICATION INTEGRATES SEAMLESS SHOPPING EXPERIENCES, ALLOWING USERS TO BROWSE AND PURCHASE RECOMMENDED OUTFITS DIRECTLY.)
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1047 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 311 0 R
/E (AT THE FINAL STAGE OF THE PROJECT, USABILITY TESTING WAS CONDUCTED TO EVALUATE THE APPLICATION'S EFFECTIVENESS, EFFICIENCY, AND USER SATISFACTION. THE TESTING PROCESS INVOLVED REAL USERS PROVIDING FEEDBACK ON THE INTERFACE, EASE OF NAVIGATION, AND THE ACCURACY OF PERSONALIZED RECOMMENDATIONS. THE RESULTS HELPED REFINE THE DESIGN, IMPROVE ACCESSIBILITY, AND ENHANCE USER ENGAGEMENT, ENSURING A SEAMLESS AND ENJOYABLE EXPERIENCE FOR ALL USERS.)
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
