<<
/Title (THE APPLICATION SHOULD BE  UTILITY AND LEARNABILITY BY ENABLING USERS TO EASILY INPUT DETAILS LIKE SKIN TONE, BODY SHAPE, HEIGHT, AND WEIGHT THROUGH A STRAIGHTFORWARD AND USER-FRIENDLY DESIGN. ADDITIONALLY, INTUITIVE, EFFICIENT, AND ACCESSIBLE. INTUITIVENESS ENSURES THAT USERS CAN INPUT THEIR PHYSICAL ATTRIBUTES LIKE HEIGHT OR SKIN TONE WITH MINIMAL EFFORT. EFFICIENCY ALLOWS FOR QUICK GENERATION OF PERSONALIZED FASHION RECOMMENDATIONS, REDUCING DECISION-MAKING TIME. ACCESSIBILITY ENSURES THAT THE APP CATERS TO DIVERSE USERS, INCLUDING THOSE WITH VARYING TECHNOLOGICAL SKILLS, PROVIDING AN INCLUSIVE EXPERIENCE.)
